<description>&lt;p&gt;Kenyan-led forces and Erik Prince's contractors are striking gang positions in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff with drones and air support, while Sri Lankan police, army and a Bangladesh UN advance team have been deployed to Haiti. The United Nations renewed sanctions on Haiti and allocated US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. Four soldiers are missing after a gang attack and five Salvadoran soldiers disappeared following an ambush, indicating ongoing threats to foreign troops. Elections remain on hold as gangs adapt to the security crackdown, and 193 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168598&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNQmdIY1IzVXVVZXYwUTAzT0FYRHFHUE1vSGQteUFHS1ZkODdaakJDVGZNQ2NHcjM0TXFJY1czc29LU2l6bTRuU1RoZlp0bDBRdkJjQ0ZteTN2aEZXR1VsVHFBVWM2Y2VoMHp2cU9ESjBiZlg3LUhyZFM2ZWlPWHpXVkdqaHQyRFZxdFpSRHBNX0VrVGRqRHdhaVRYeE1SN2VlMEYza0RMVVNCMTZYTmxrbWQ4UV92TUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE43S3V4VVdnclB2TkVjVnNQcjJJeG1DVkc5bjZzTTc4bmFTRTdhQ05hU0NhVS0tN2R4aHprRkpsR096Z1JZUXdCeFBfREZ2XzNqc3JUZkwwbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQWnBsblFFQ0c2dThVYmx0dlNabXFfYm95MmNTaGFBTE1ISFdURmVRTTVvcFZtVDBMdDh4NjBaX2xZWlhyNUw1bEpRem9aY3VnWTBuaVBURjRHYmdZMjdUekJVYXRyZ1Q1TjB2S3d5T0xseGhub3JIc2RpMzVsa0g0elVjNW5KX2ljbDNwUUJNMl9qZGtsUzdxRjVNNzNxYU9VMlMwZXJLaUcya243?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFBJalhjbVk1U2Z2YnJPYnFVMG1MamRsYXU5cFpuMkhwMnZuNGoxbzB2Q1lkNUd4RWxGeEg2blVTU